{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\nTVB節目《女神配對計劃 2》最新一集迎來突破性發展！一向被動怕醜的方智弘（Oscar）在與何沛珈（Roxanne）的露營夜中，竟罕有地主動出擊，不但以「四眼素顏Look」真誠相對，更詳細列出對Roxanne的三大心動時刻，最後更鼓起勇氣直接邀請約會，兩人曖昧互窒的互動火花四濺，究竟Oscar說了什麼讓Roxanne冧爆答應？\n</p>\n<h2>Oscar素顏攤牌 揭3大心動時刻</h2>\n<p>在（15日）播出的節目中，Oscar與Roxanne在「玻璃水世界」前紮營過夜，兩人還未入夜已雙雙以素顏戴眼鏡的模樣輕鬆對談。Oscar一改寡言形象，向Roxanne坦白三大心動Moment，分別是「電話亭」、「水上滑梯爆喊事件」及「失驚無神食蘋果」。他直言這些時刻讓他看到Roxanne有趣又率真的靈魂，更表示：「畀著其他人，可能覺得佢好奇怪，但老實講對我係覺得幾好笑，幾開心。」當中，令Oscar最難忘的竟是Roxanne玩滑梯時突然爆喊，他憶述：「好深刻真係，因為我覺得拍緊嘢架，咁多人喺度…」對於Oscar的坦白，Roxanne也驚訝表示：「估你唔到」、「原來佢同我都幾奇怪。」</p>\n<h2>Oscar一改被動誠邀約會 Roxanne冧爆秒答應</h2>\n<p>除了坦承心動，Oscar更乘勝追擊，正式向Roxanne提出約會邀請：「節目組話可以畀我邀請女神約會一日，我喺呢度誠意邀請你一齊去玩一日，想了解多啲，咁你點睇呢單嘢？」突如其來的邀請讓Roxanne心花怒放，爽快秒答：「去呀，去呀，去吖！」不過兩人隨即就約會要不要玩機動遊戲展開拉鋸戰，一時互踩對方細膽，一時又堅稱自己很Tough，充滿火花的互動猶如情侶。事後Oscar更首次明確表示心意已定：「其實由我同Roxanne過夜嗰吓開始，我個心就偏向佢喇已經。」</p>\n<h2>網民洗版激讚有粉紅泡泡：呢啲先係拍拖模式</h2>\n<p>Oscar與Roxanne之間輕鬆又自然的相處模式，引來網民一面倒好評，紛紛表示支持二人發展。留言區被讚賞洗版：「好好呀，感覺到佢哋相處好舒服」、「極似情侶未一齊之前嘅曖昧互窒」、「打打鬧鬧好有CP感」、「真係有粉紅泡泡喎」、「呢啲先係年輕人嘅拍拖模式，咁樣先好玩」。更有網民大讚兩人素顏的樣子比平時化妝更好看：「佢哋兩個都有嗰句講嗰句」、「鍾意佢哋會寸」、「其實何小姐講嘢幾搞笑吖」、「佢哋真係輕鬆自在喎」。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/02_8606858746afa834541117.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/02_8606858746afa834541117.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/03_16096919186afa834cdfb64.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/03_16096919186afa834cdfb64.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/10_12864277226afa837e9c2e0.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/10_12864277226afa837e9c2e0.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/16_20031449796afa83a5eb765.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/16_20031449796afa83a5eb765.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/18_9688514996afa83b43635b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/18_9688514996afa83b43635b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/19_3617256536afa83b9eb3ff.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/19_3617256536afa83b9eb3ff.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/14_4918311386afa839a0ead3.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/14_4918311386afa839a0ead3.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/21_7844936156afa83c61a26f.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/21_7844936156afa83c61a26f.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/22_8482808336afa83cb4c621.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/22_8482808336afa83cb4c621.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/23_11622207146afa83d1db9a8.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/23_11622207146afa83d1db9a8.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T07:13:59.319418+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1284,"images":10,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T06:30:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T07:27:56.601009+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T07:07:37.193053+00:00","content_hash":"fa9b0192ee8f0247da38674761bdfa61df075ebf5a5cd48dfb6814ca40589f85","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}